{"seq":2,"slug":"credit-risk","title":"信用风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/financial-engineering/risk-management/credit-risk","wordCount":668,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"信用风险\">信用风险</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>信用风险是交易对手无法履行合约义务（违约）而导致损失的风险。在所有金融风险中，信用风险造成的累计损失最大——2008 年金融危机的核心就是信用风险的系统性爆发。对程序员而言，信用风险模型是金融科技中最重要的应用场景之一，从信用评分到贷款审批都依赖信用风险分析。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[信用风险] --&gt; B[违约风险]&#10;    A --&gt; C[信用迁移风险]&#10;    A --&gt; D[回收风险]&#10;    B --&gt; E[违约概率PD]&#10;    B --&gt; F[违约损失率LGD]&#10;    B --&gt; G[违约敞口EAD]&#10;    E --&gt; H[预期损失 = PD × LGD × EAD]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[信用风险] --&gt; B[违约风险]\n    A --&gt; C[信用迁移风险]\n    A --&gt; D[回收风险]\n    B --&gt; E[违约概率PD]\n    B --&gt; F[违约损失率LGD]\n    B --&gt; G[违约敞口EAD]\n    E --&gt; H[预期损失 = PD × LGD × EAD]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信用风险要素</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>估计方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>违约概率 PD</td>\n<td>借款人在给定期限内违约的概率</td>\n<td>0.01%-15%</td>\n<td>信用评分模型、评级迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>违约损失率 LGD</td>\n<td>违约时无法收回的比例</td>\n<td>20%-80%</td>\n<td>历史回收率分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>违约敞口 EAD</td>\n<td>违约时的风险暴露金额</td>\n<td>贷款余额</td>\n<td>合同金额+未使用额度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预期损失 EL</td>\n<td>长期平均的信用损失</td>\n<td>PD×LGD×EAD</td>\n<td>三要素乘积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非预期损失 UL</td>\n<td>超出预期的潜在损失</td>\n<td>标准差度量</td>\n<td>信用VaR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"信用评分模型\">信用评分模型</h2><p>信用评分模型是信用风险管理的核心工具，它将借款人的特征转化为违约概率的预测。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BorrowerFeatures {&#10;  income: number;&#10;  debtToIncome: number;&#10;  creditHistory: number;&#10;  employmentYears: number;&#10;  existingLoans: number;&#10;  age: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CreditScore {&#10;  score: number;&#10;  pd: number;&#10;  rating: string;&#10;  decision: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const logisticCreditScore = (features: BorrowerFeatures): CreditScore =&gt; {&#10;  const weights = {&#10;    income: -0.00002,&#10;    debtToIncome: 3.5,&#10;    creditHistory: -0.5,&#10;    employmentYears: -0.15,&#10;    existingLoans: 0.8,&#10;    age: -0.02,&#10;  };&#10;  const intercept = 1.5;&#10;&#10;  const logit =&#10;    intercept +&#10;    weights.income * features.income +&#10;    weights.debtToIncome * features.debtToIncome +&#10;    weights.creditHistory * features.creditHistory +&#10;    weights.employmentYears * features.employmentYears +&#10;    weights.existingLoans * features.existingLoans +&#10;    weights.age * features.age;&#10;&#10;  const pd = 1 / (1 + Math.exp(-logit));&#10;  const score = Math.round(300 + 550 * (1 - pd));&#10;&#10;  let rating: string;&#10;  let decision: string;&#10;  if (score &gt;= 750) {&#10;    rating = &#39;A&#39;;&#10;    decision = &#39;批准，优惠利率&#39;;&#10;  } else if (score &gt;= 650) {&#10;    rating = &#39;B&#39;;&#10;    decision = &#39;批准，标准利率&#39;;&#10;  } else if (score &gt;= 550) {&#10;    rating = &#39;C&#39;;&#10;    decision = &#39;批准，上浮利率&#39;;&#10;  } else {&#10;    rating = &#39;D&#39;;&#10;    decision = &#39;拒绝&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return { score, pd: Math.round(pd * 10000) / 100, rating, decision };&#10;};&#10;&#10;const applicants: BorrowerFeatures[] = [&#10;  { income: 300000, debtToIncome: 0.2, creditHistory: 8, employmentYears: 10, existingLoans: 1, age: 35 },&#10;  { income: 150000, debtToIncome: 0.5, creditHistory: 3, employmentYears: 2, existingLoans: 3, age: 25 },&#10;  { income: 80000, debtToIncome: 0.7, creditHistory: 1, employmentYears: 1, existingLoans: 5, age: 22 },&#10;];&#10;&#10;applicants.forEach((a, i) =&gt; {&#10;  const result = logisticCreditScore(a);&#10;  console.log(`申请人${i + 1}: 评分=${result.score}, PD=${result.pd}%, 评级=${result.rating}, ${result.decision}`);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BorrowerFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  income</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  debtToIncome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  creditHistory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  employmentYears</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  existingLoans</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style